{"version":1,"key":"card:408","content":{"id":408,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"宇宙的组成："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"常规物质：5%"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由三种基本粒子组成，上夸克、下夸克和电子"}]}]}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有一些其它的基本粒子，但是这些粒子并不组成物质，其作用也不得而知"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_dc383802-6462-4964-a45e-c9500859e904.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"还有五种传递力的粒子"}]},{"type":"image","url":"https://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d552f223-7059-4d47-a3d6-ed04643bdcb4.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这些基本粒子是否是最小的，不得而知，但是是我们目前发现的最小的粒子，是否只存在上述所说的 17 种基本粒子，也不得而知，也许存在更多的基本粒子尚未被发现"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"暗物质：27%"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为什么称之为暗物质"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它看不见，所以称之为暗"}]}]}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"它有质量，因此称之为物质"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"暗物质存在的证据"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"星系自转"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果不存在暗物质，那么按照已有星系的自传速度，恒星会被甩出星系，但是实际上没有，说明存在暗物质把恒星束缚住了"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"引力透镜"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"从两个不同的角度观察，看到了同一个星系，说明存在一个不可见的物质充当了一个透镜，弯曲了星系发出的光线"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"星系碰撞"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"两个星系碰撞，观察到星系发出的光被暗物质扭曲了"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"暗能量：68%"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"宇宙在不断的膨胀，而且膨胀的速度越来越快，这个使得宇宙膨胀速度越来越快的东西我们称之为暗能量。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"暗表示看不见，能量把所有东西都推开。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"暗能量是什么，当前一个比较流行的说法是：暗能量来自空的空间的能量。"}]}]}]}],"tags":["科普/宇宙"],"createTime":1707744239694,"updateTime":1743303640428,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640428}}